  Description: Prerequisite Region - Broken Lands You grew up among the northern
    houses of Brevoy in old Issia. Steeped in the cultural legacy of pirates and
    smugglers, you rely on your cleverness and charm as you make your way throughout
    the world. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Intelligence or Charisma
    , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Deception skill and
    the Underworld Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Charming
    Liar] skill feat.
